### =========================================================================
### DEVA YADHALA PORTFOLIO - SPRING BOOT REST API & JWT TEST SUITE
### =========================================================================
### Compatible with:
### - VS Code (REST Client extension by Huachao Mao)
### - IntelliJ IDEA / Aqua / WebStorm (Built-in HTTP Client)
### - Postman / Insomnia (Can import directly or use requests below)
### =========================================================================

@host = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json
@adminUsername = devayadhala04@gmail.com
@adminPassword = BhavyaSri@07

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. SWAGGER UI & OPENAPI DOCUMENTATION (PUBLIC)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Fetch OpenAPI 3 JSON Schema
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 1.2 Access Swagger UI HTML
GET {{host}}/swagger-ui/index.html


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PUBLIC PORTFOLIO DATA APIS (PUBLIC - NO AUTH REQUIRED)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Get All Projects
GET {{host}}/api/projects
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2.2 Get Project by ID
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2.3 Get All Skills
GET {{host}}/api/skills
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2.4 Get Skills Grouped by Category
GET {{host}}/api/skills/grouped
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2.5 Get Work & Internship Experience
GET {{host}}/api/experience
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2.6 Get Certifications & Credentials
GET {{host}}/api/certifications
Accept: {{contentType}}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CONTACT FORM INQUIRIES (PUBLIC)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 Submit Contact Inquiry (Valid)
# @name submitContact
POST {{host}}/api/contact
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Sarah Jenkins",
  "email": "sarah.jenkins@techrecruiter.com",
  "subject": "Full Stack Engineer Role Discussion",
  "message": "Hi Deva, we were very impressed by your portfolio and projects. We would love to discuss a developer opportunity with our engineering team."
}

### 3.2 Submit Contact Inquiry (Validation Failure Example - Invalid Email)
POST {{host}}/api/contact
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "subject": "",
  "message": "Too short"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. AUTHENTICATION & JWT TOKEN GENERATION
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Admin Login (Generates JWT Token)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "{{adminUsername}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Auto-captured JWT Bearer token from login response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.token}}


### 4.2 Get Current Authenticated Admin Profile (Using JWT)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4.3 Admin Login (Invalid Credentials - Expects 401 Unauthorized)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "{{adminUsername}}",
  "password": "wrongPassword999!"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. PROTECTED ADMIN ENDPOINTS (REQUIRES JWT BEARER TOKEN)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Get Admin Dashboard Analytics & Summary Counts
GET {{host}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5.2 Get All Contact Inquiries
GET {{host}}/api/admin/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5.3 Mark Contact Message as READ (Replace ID if needed)
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/messages/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "READ"
}

### 5.4 Mark Contact Message as REPLIED
PATCH {{host}}/api/admin/messages/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "REPLIED"
}


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. SECURITY ACCESS CONTROL TESTS (NEGATIVE SCENARIOS)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Access Admin Stats WITHOUT Token (Expects 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/stats
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6.2 Access Admin Stats with TAMPERED / INVALID Token (Expects 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.tampered.token
Accept: {{contentType}}
